    <statement><p>Find a parametrization of the circle of radius
<m>8</m> in the xy-plane, centered at the origin,
oriented clockwise.  The point <m>(8,0)</m> 
should correspond to <m>t = 0</m>.  Use <m>t</m> as the 
parameter for all of your answers.</p>
<p><m>x(t) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>y(t) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_1"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>8\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right);\,-8\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
